</table>
<figcaption class="ltx_caption ltx_centering"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_table">Table 12: </span>Percentage of <span id="A6.T12.4" class="ltx_text ltx_font_smallcaps">All<sup id="A6.T12.4.1" class="ltx_sup">
