</section>
<section id="A10" class="ltx_appendix">
<h2 class="ltx_title ltx_title_appendix"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_appendix">Appendix J </span>ORPO Complete Results</h2>

<div id="A10.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A10.p1.1" class="ltx_p">Table <a href="#A10.T15" title="Table 15 ‣ Appendix J ORPO Complete Results ‣ CrisiText: A dataset of warning messages for LLM training in emergency communication" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">15</span></a> presents the complete results of all ORPO training setups.</p>
</div>
<figure id="A10.T15" class="ltx_table">
