<section id="A11" class="ltx_appendix">
<h2 class="ltx_title ltx_title_appendix"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_appendix">Appendix K </span>LOSO Complete results</h2>

<div id="A11.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A11.p1.1" class="ltx_p">Complete results for the LOSO experiments are reported in Table <a href="#A11.T16" title="Table 16 ‣ Appendix K LOSO Complete results ‣ CrisiText: A dataset of warning messages for LLM training in emergency communication" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">16</span></a>. Notice that, even on these metrics, the Tornado typology does not show major differences between fine-tuning with Instructions and without Instructions.</p>
</div>
