<section id="A12" class="ltx_appendix">
<h2 class="ltx_title ltx_title_appendix"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_appendix">Appendix L </span>Generation Qualitative Analysis</h2>

<div id="A12.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A12.p1.1" class="ltx_p">To gain better insights on the characteristics of the generated warning messages, we performed a qualitative analysis comparing the main approaches we used: zero-shot, few-shot, and SFT. In this analysis we included the best- vs worst-performing setups of each technique. The chosen worst setups are Zero-shot, Few-shot, and SFT, while the best ones are Zero-shot<sub id="A12.p1.1.1" class="ltx_sub">C+I</sub>, Few-shot<sub id="A12.p1.1.2" class="ltx_sub">C+I</sub>, and SFT<sub id="A12.p1.1.3" class="ltx_sub">I+M</sub>.</p>
</div>
